  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Maps and methods from Paradise Earth inheritance and Mushroomman Paradise list locations of dream path immortal materials underground in Southern Border. After taking earth dream fetus hair, Fang Yuan goes to another location where there are many nine tune dream flowers. Meng Qiu Zhen is to retrieve these dream path immortal materials and plant resources in his immortal aperture.",
