        2094
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-harvest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "loc_mushroomman_paradise",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_meng_qiu_zhen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Meng Zhen immortal aperture, a small sea of flowers at the north-most part is all nine tune dream flowers. Each flower has only one petal, which spirals upward from the roots into a spiral form with nine layers.",
      "chapters": [
        2097
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "form-in-meng-zhen",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nine tune dream flower is listed with earth dream fetus hair, dream river water, tongue tip small dream fish, and dream sand as the dream path Gu materials Fang Yuan obtained in that period. Dream path Gu materials are still rare; after nearly ransacking Southern Border’s underground, he collected only this much. Moved into Meng Zhen immortal aperture, they leave earth path suppression and can grow under dream path dao marks.",
